Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.35,0:01:08.94,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\clip(320,1,320,460)\t(100,970,\clip(10,1,590,400))\fad(0,300)\blur1}无论路途多么遥远
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.21,0:01:13.98,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\clip(320,1,320,460)\t(100,970,\clip(10,1,590,400))\fad(0,300)\blur1}也曾有勇气迈出第一步
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.65,0:01:17.20,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\clip(320,1,320,460)\t(100,970,\clip(10,1,590,400))\fad(0,300)\blur1}无论无数次碰撞
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.20,0:01:20.00,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\clip(320,1,320,460)\t(100,970,\clip(10,1,590,400))\fad(0,300)\blur1}不管跌倒多少次
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.05,0:01:24.95,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\clip(320,1,320,460)\t(100,970,\clip(10,1,590,400))\fad(0,300)\blur1}心中坚信一定能抵达
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.06,0:01:40.97,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\clip(320,1,320,460)\t(100,970,\clip(10,1,590,400))\fad(0,300)\blur1}始终追寻着那日所见的风景
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.35,0:01:45.98,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\clip(320,1,320,460)\t(100,970,\clip(10,1,590,400))\fad(0,300)\blur1}可只是一味追赶 却怎么也追不上
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.53,0:01:49.18,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\clip(320,1,320,460)\t(100,970,\clip(10,1,590,400))\fad(0,300)\blur1}哪怕挑战数千回
